'''Vaulter Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] increases health, movement speed, and [[Slow|slow]] duration. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]]. She was later added into [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] and can be unlocked via rolling the Rare Capsule.

