==Trivia==
*Vaulter Cat, along with [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener Cat]] and the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION set]], were re-introduced into [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in the 1.0.6 update, retaining its original attributes but lacking a [[True Form]].
*Housewife Cat may be based on the Dutch track and field athlete [[Wikipedia:Fanny Blankers-Koen|Francina Elsje Blankers-Koen]], also nicknamed "the Flying Housewife". She was best known for winning four gold medals in the London 1948 Summer Olympics, competing as 30 year-old mother of two. In 1940, she became engaged to and later married Jan Blankers, who was then a sports journalist and the coach of the Dutch women's athletics team.

